<title>USA: Precision Castparts names Riedel Pres/COO.</title>
<headline>Precision Castparts names Riedel Pres/COO.</headline>
<dateline>PORTLAND, Ore. 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Precision Castparts Corp Wednesday named Steven Riedel, a former General Electric Co vice president, to the post of president and chief operating officer.</p>
</text>
